INSERT INTO `faqs` VALUES (1,'How does the AI Quran voice feedback work?','The system leverages modern Web Speech recognition combined with an Arabic phonetic normalization algorithm. As you recite into your microphone, the AI matches your spoken Arabic words against the Uthmani script of the selected Ayah, color-coding correctly matched words in green and pointing out areas needing repetition in amber or red.',1,1,'2026-10-19 00:28:57','2026-10-19 00:28:57'),(2,'Does this platform replace human Quran teachers?','Our platform is designed as an intelligent home practice companion. While our AI gives rapid real-time feedback on pronunciation accuracy and verse sequencing, we enthusiastically advocate continued study with certified Quran scholars (Ijaza holders) for nuanced Tajweed rules.',2,1,'2026-10-19 00:28:57','2026-10-19 00:28:57'),(3,'Which audio reciters are available on the platform?','We provide crystal-clear verse-by-verse recitations from celebrated Qaris including Sheikh Mishary Rashid Alafasy, Sheikh Abdul Basit Abdul Samad, Sheikh Mahmoud Khalil Al-Husary, and Sheikh Abu Bakr Al-Shatri.',3,1,'2026-10-19 00:28:57','2026-10-19 00:28:57'),(4,'How does the Hifz (Memorization) module track my retention?','The Hifz module employs a spaced-repetition algorithm. When you mark an Ayah or Surah as memorized, the system automatically schedules review dates at increasing intervals (1 day, 3 days, 7 days, 14 days, 30 days) to lock the verses securely into your long-term memory.',4,1,'2026-10-19 00:28:57','2026-10-19 00:28:57'),(5,'Can I practice on mobile phones and tablets?','Yes! The entire interface is built on responsive Bootstrap 5.3 standards and works seamlessly on Chrome, Safari, Edge, and Firefox across iPhones, Android phones, iPads, and desktop computers.',5,1,'2026-10-19 00:28:57','2026-10-19 00:28:57'),(6,'Are my voice recordings saved or shared?','No. Audio analysis is executed transiently in memory for real-time comparison. We do not store raw microphone audio files on our servers, ensuring complete privacy for you and your family.',6,1,'2026-10-19 00:28:57','2026-10-19 00:28:57');
/*!40000 ALTER TABLE `faqs` ENABLE KEYS */;
UNLOCK TABLES;

